# Astro pages & components

- Prefer `.astro` over client islands; JS only for state/browser APIs
- Wrap pages in `<Layout>`; use `PAGE_*` / `NEXTUP_*` classes from `src/utils/constants.ts`
- Internal links: `pageHref(...segments)` from `src/utils/url.ts` (trailing slash)
- Buttons/links: `<Button>` — variants `primary | outline | ghost | simple`; sizes `sm | md | none`
- Mark copy with `data-i18n` / `data-i18n-aria` / `data-i18n-alt`; SSR strings via `t()` (Catalan default)
- Scroll fade-in: `class="reveal"`
- Keep brief HTML comments only where they orient structure (header zones, page sections)

```astro
<script>
  document.addEventListener("astro:page-load", () => {
    /* init after every navigation */
  });
</script>
```
